(its easiest to come up with much deeper and more intricate plot when I don't have to focus on multiple players) and those usually go for five to seven hours after I include Court, Clan meetings, and then the various other events that occur outside of Elysium.<br /> <br /> I used to run online games, but stopped because it was impossible to find players who would step away from other online stuff and wouldn't take 10 to 20 minutes between every response, which would result in even a single Court event taking upwards of 12 hours to resolve. No bueno.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":220,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/220-thearchitect","user":"TheArchitect","date":". 01-12-2019, 09:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/220-thearchitect","name":"TheArchitect","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T22:52:54-08:00","id":1280268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1280173-how-long-are-your-roleplaying-sessions?p=1280214#post1280214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Game sessions run about 3-4 hours currently but that is due to having small kids and work to handle as well but then again we compensate by playing 3-4 sessions per week.<br /> <br /> Never had time or need for an online game as players have for now been available locally.</div> </div> </div> </div>So 9-16 hours in a week?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-12T00:02:40-08:00","id":1280276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PhillyCuriosity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1280173-how-long-are-your-roleplaying-sessions?p=1280268#post1280268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So 9-16 hours in a week?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats about right, yes, barring scheduling problems with work/kids.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-12T09:13:46-08:00","id":1280327,"title":"","content":"Feeling a little sting of Envy here...<br /> <br /> We play once a Month with the session taking 9-12 hours.<br /> Half of the group has kids (me included)<br /> Age is between 23 and 37, 2-4 guys and my younger sister.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-13T13:33:39-08:00","id":1280541,"title":"","content":"I've been running a Demon the Fallen campaign with my troupe for about 2 1/2 years, playing once/week or once every two weeks over roll20. We play in 1-2 hour sessions, taking as many sessions as we need to finish a story (anywhere from 2-8 sessions). It's awesome. Some of us have kids (including me), and it's pretty easy to carve out an hour or two on a week night. We just did session 80 last week, nearing the end of the chronicle. We will have completed 23 stories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13564-trategos_sol","name":"Trategos_Sol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13564_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-14T15:36:58-08:00","id":1280780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trategos_Sol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1280173-how-long-are-your-roleplaying-sessions?p=1280541#post1280541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been running a Demon the Fallen campaign with my troupe for about 2 1/2 years, playing once/week or once every two weeks over roll20. We play in 1-2 hour sessions, taking as many sessions as we need to finish a story (anywhere from 2-8 sessions). It's awesome. Some of us have kids (including me), and it's pretty easy to carve out an hour or two on a week night. We just did session 80 last week, nearing the end of the chronicle. We will have completed 23 stories.</div> </div> </div> </div>Any crossover experience with Mage, by chance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-14T16:18:14-08:00","id":1280789,"title":"","content":"My WtA game lasts 2.5-3 hours on regular nights. Sometimes we cap off stories with large battles or complex trials... the last one of those was on New Years and we played for 7 hours.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-15T08:27:41-08:00","id":1280907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by 