apped up in December.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T14:28:51-08:00","id":1281373,"title":"","content":"Between 9 and 12 hours -- but we only our big group game between 6-9 times per year. All of us are in our mid-30's; some have kids; two of us have busy law practices; two of us are teachers constantly hustling to find an extra buck; one of us is long-haul truck driver whose availability is unpredictable <i>at best</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-17T17:26:16-08:00","id":1281402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PhillyCuriosity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1280173-how-long-are-your-roleplaying-sessions?p=1280780#post1280780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any crossover experience with Mage, by chance?</div